<http://data.silknow.org/object/faaee696-edb7-38ef-88fd-06703f784478/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Panel of brown tabby silk below and tan silk above woven with gilt strip and brocaded with coloured silks: dark and light blue, pale greens, orange, yellow, white, dark green and golden brown. \n\nThe design consists of waves with bundles of leaves and flowers below, a stylised mountain and free growing flowers above.\n\nThe silk is backed with a late 19th century printed cotton, with large flowers in pink, red, blue, white and green against vivid blue and black stripes on a white ground."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/faaee696-edb7-38ef-88fd-06703f784478> .

