        rdfs:comment                   "Panel of brown tabby silk below and tan silk above woven with gilt strip and brocaded with coloured silks: dark and light blue, pale greens, orange, yellow, white, dark green and golden brown. \n\nThe design consists of waves with bundles of leaves and flowers below, a stylised mountain and free growing flowers above.\n\nThe silk is backed with a late 19th century printed cotton, with large flowers in pink, red, blue, white and green against vivid blue and black stripes on a white ground."@en , "Panel of brocaded silk, Japan, 19th century"@en ;
